{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-0f2591095192", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:40:37.430Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 0, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:40:44.784Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 13372, "tokens_out": 111, "latency": 7.3299, "finish_reason": "tool_use"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "What does the Thornfield Commercial Property wording say about business interruption cover?", "prompt_hash": "sha256:b3db0fc73e66aa44de0a8c455dc234ae0485a646d88a7a817a855fdee8fa3c36", "response_text": "I'll search the Thornfield Mutual documents for information about business interruption cover in the Commercial Property wording.", "response_hash": "sha256:fadad7fe4061195b908df8379ab85977d1cd5819f16f0f4b1fd94f8430c1098a", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-0f2591095192", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:40:37.430Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:40:45.052Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 15146, "tokens_out": 218, "latency": 0.2677, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "What does the Thornfield Commercial Property wording say about business interruption cover?", "prompt_hash": "sha256:b3db0fc73e66aa44de0a8c455dc234ae0485a646d88a7a817a855fdee8fa3c36", "response_text": "Based on the Thornfield Mutual documents, here's what the Commercial Property wording says about business interruption cover:\n\n**Section 2: Business Interruption** (pol-commprop-003#c00)\n\n- **Loss covered**: Loss of gross profit following damage covered under Section 1 (material damage)\n- **Indemnity period**: The period is stated in the schedule. Standard options are 12, 18 or 24 months\n- **Increased cost of working**: This is covered where the additional spend reduces the loss of gross profit by at least the amount spent\n- **Denial of access**: Covered up to £250,000 where damage within a one-mile radius prevents access to the premises\n\nThe cover applies to businesses with declared turnover up to £25,000,000.\n\nThis is a summary from the policy wording. If you need more detailed terms or conditions, or the full wording, let me know and I can search for additional detail.", "response_hash": "sha256:4bf64654dbf6bd967105307dd5fa0ba28e7a41d3bfa90e96721534f00133ee72", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
